      The logits.
    sequence_length: 1-D `int32` vector containing sequence lengths, having size
      `[batch_size]`.
    beam_width: An int scalar >= 0 (beam search beam width).
    top_paths: An int scalar >= 0, <= beam_width (controls output size).

